{"pull": {"id": "number:19501", "number": 19501, "title": "KAFKA-18752: Fix the warning of no-operation caused by slf4j in building kafka", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-04-17T06:21:07Z", "closed_at": "2026-02-23T04:17:59Z", "merged_at": null, "user": {"login": "frankvicky", "id": 51072200, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDcyMjAw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51072200?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky", "html_url": "https://github.com/frankvicky", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "JIRA: KAFKA-18752  In KAFKA-18466, we remove the slf4j impl from runtime\nscope to fix the compatibility issue (see\nhttps://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/17373#issuecomment-2580893706).\nHowever, that also causes a side effect: when running some tasks, slf4j\ncan't find any provider as they are included in \"release-only\". We could\nfix this by adding releaseOnly to the class path.\n\nThis patch leverages the task collection API to enable specific tasks to\naccess `releaseOnly` dependencies.\n", "labels": [{"id": 5604089486, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABTgeejg", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/stale", "name": "stale", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Stale PRs",